{"title":"Career roadmap · Museum Assistant","role":"Museum Assistant","summary":"A Museum Assistant supports the preservation, documentation, cataloguing, display, interpretation, and day-to-day management of museum collections.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A Museum Assistant supports the preservation, documentation, cataloguing, display, interpretation, and day-to-day management of museum collections."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Ancient Indian History, Culture & Archaeology is particularly relevant for museums holding archaeological artefacts, sculptures, coins, inscriptions, manuscripts, paintings, ceramics, textiles, and other cultural-heritage collections."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest career profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Ancient History","Archaeology","Museology","Collection Management","Conservation Awareness","Digital Heritage"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Museum Intern, Collection Assistant"},{"text":"Documentation and collection support"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Museum Assistant, Museum Documentation Assistant"},{"text":"Cataloguing and visitor/collection services"}],[{"text":"Developing"},{"text":"Collections Assistant, Museum Educator"},{"text":"Collections and public engagement"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Curatorial Assistant, Collections Specialist"},{"text":"Research and collection management"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Curator, Senior Curator, Museum Specialist"},{"text":"Exhibitions, research and collections"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Museum Manager, Collections Manager"},{"text":"Museum operations and strategy"}],[{"text":"Senior Leadership"},{"text":"Museum Director, Heritage Institution Head"},{"text":"Institutional lead