{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Government museums, major public institutions, and professional curator/archaeology posts often have specific qualification and recruitment requirements. A BA alone should not be assumed to qualify someone for every museum or archaeological position."},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Object identification"},{"type":"p","text":"How would you document an unfamiliar archaeological artefact?"},{"type":"h","text":"Collection management"},{"type":"p","text":"What information should be included in an object catalogue record?"},{"type":"h","text":"Conservation"},{"type":"p","text":"What environmental factors can damage museum collections?"},{"type":"h","text":"Provenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Why is provenance important when acquiring or displaying an object?"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a small exhibition around a historical theme."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital heritage"},{"type":"p","text":"How could GIS improve archaeological heritage management?"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"How would you verify the historical interpretation of an artefact?"},{"type":"h","text":"Practical assignment"},{"type":"p","text":"The candidate may receive an object photograph and be asked to create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Object title"},{"text":"Object category"},{"text":"Material"},{"text":"Period"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Historical context"},{"text":"Condition notes"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Display requirements"},{"text":"Bibliographic references"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For stronger museum and heritage careers:"},{"type":"h","text":"Museum studies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA/Master's in Museology"},{"text":"Museum Studies"},{"text":"Heritage Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA/MSc Archaeology"},{"text":"Ancien